{"id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-ce-set.md","title":"Computably Enumerable Set","display":"df-ce-set — Computably Enumerable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-ce-set","aliases":["88-df-ce-set","CE","c.e."],"display":"df-ce-set — Computably Enumerable Set","depends_on":["[[88-df-computable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-ce-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-ce-set</span><span>CE</span><span>c.e.</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ce-set — Computably Enumerable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (candidate subset of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\)</span> (computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> (partial-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dom}\">\\(\\mathrm{dom}\\)</span> (domain operation, set-theoretic standard symbol)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>集合是 c.e. 当且仅当它是某一元部分可计算函数的定义域。非空 c.e. 集\n也等价于某总可计算函数的值域；空集没有从非空定义域<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>出发的\n总函数枚举，所以后一表述必须附加“非空”或允许部分枚举器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}(f)$ (computability predicate, see [[88-df-computable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":1133,"backlinks":[{"id":"1615ef12adfef528","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ (computably enumerable predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"a68fcc877c0f577e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"ceae3257aec622e2","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"f95558608cb43df9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]。"},{"id":"5b4a0fd8b4ab9631","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(K)$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"5946096a2536364f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"499d6d1436229742","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"5e8f3c4b1c542063","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}$ (set of natural numbers, see [[88-df-ce-set]])"},{"id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]。"},{"id":"fbf21d26a14b4aa1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ (computably-enumerable pr